  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "保險發展與實務",
    "sub_ename": "THE DEVELOPMENT AND PRACTICES OF INSURANCE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程講授風險與保險學的基本理論、實務運用與未來之發展。首先介紹風險、傳統風險管理與整合型風險管理之發展；再說明保險業的基本運作:產品設計、定價核保、通路管理與出險理賠，接者介紹保險科技對傳統保險價值鏈帶來破壞式創新，以及目前實務應用，並闡述未來的可能發展與趨勢。",
    "describe_eh": "Risk and Insurance theory, its practical application as well as future development are introduced in this course. The first part of this course introduces the development of risk, traditional risk management and integrated risk management, and then describes the basic operation of insurance including product design, pricing and underwriting, channel management and settlement of insurance claim. The second part demonstrates that insurance technology brings in disruptive innovations of traditional value chains. We will take many examples of practical applications, and illustrate future development trends of insurance industry.",
    "pre_subname": "",
